sequenceDiagram
    title 孕程记 V1.0 — 核心业务序列图

    participant User as 用户 (浏览器)
    participant Router as Vue Router
    participant View as 页面视图
    participant Store as Pinia Store
    participant API as Axios Client
    participant MW as AuthMiddleware
    participant Router_BE as FastAPI Router
    participant DB as SQLite (aiosqlite)

    %% ===== 1. 应用启动 & 设置检查 =====
    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,DB: 1. 应用启动 — 设置向导检查
        User->>Router: 访问任意页面
        Router->>API: GET /app-config/setup_status
        API->>Router_BE: HTTP GET /api/v1/app-config/setup_status
        Router_BE->>MW: 认证检查 (白名单放行)
        Router_BE->>DB: SELECT AppConfig WHERE key='setup_completed'
        DB-->>Router_BE: setup_flag
        Router_BE-->>API: {code:0, data:{is_setup_complete:bool}}
        API-->>Router: setup status
        alt 未完成设置
            Router->>User: 重定向到 /setup (SetupWizardView)
        else 已完成设置
            Router->>User: 正常进入目标页面
        end
    end

    %% ===== 2. 创建孕期档案 =====
    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,DB: 2. 创建孕期档案
        User->>View: 填写末次月经/预产期
        View->>API: pregnancyApi.create(data)
        API->>Router_BE: POST /api/v1/pregnancies
        Router_BE->>Router_BE: 计算预产期 (calculate_due_date_from_lmp)
        Router_BE->>DB: INSERT INTO pregnancy
        DB-->>Router_BE: Pregnancy 对象
        Router_BE-->>API: ApiResponse[PregnancyResponse]
        API-->>View: {code:0, data:{id, due_date, ...}}
        View-->>User: 创建成功，跳转首页
    end

    %% ===== 3. 首页 Dashboard 加载 =====
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over User,DB: 3. 首页 Dashboard 聚合查询
        User->>View: 进入首页
        View->>API: dashboardApi.get()
        API->>Router_BE: GET /api/v1/dashboard
        Router_BE->>DB: SELECT active Pregnancy
        Router_BE->>DB: SELECT today DailyRecord
        Router_BE->>DB: SELECT upcoming Reminders (7天内)
        Router_BE->>DB: SELECT last PrenatalCheckup
        Router_BE->>DB: SELECT Checklist + ChecklistItem progress
        Router_BE->>Router_BE: 加载 fetal_development.json
        Router_BE->>Router_BE: 加载 checkup_schedule.json
        Router_BE-->>API: 聚合 Dashboard 数据
        API-->>View: {code:0, data:{gestational_age, today_record, ...}}
        View-->>User: 渲染首页概览
    end

    %% ===== 4. 每日记录 Upsert =====
    rect rgb(255, 230, 255)
        Note over User,DB: 4. 每日记录 (按日期 Upsert)
        User->>View: 点击记录图标 (如体重)
        View->>View: 弹出 RecordIconGrid / WeightDialog
        User->>View: 输入数据
        View->>API: dailyRecordApi.upsert({pregnancy_id, record_date, weight})
        API->>Router_BE: POST /api/v1/daily-records
        Router_BE->>DB: SELECT DailyRecord WHERE pregnancy_id+record_date
        alt 已存在
            Router_BE->>DB: UPDATE DailyRecord
        else 不存在
            Router_BE->>DB: INSERT DailyRecord
        end
        DB-->>Router_BE: DailyRecord 对象
        Router_BE-->>API: ApiResponse[DailyRecordResponse]
        API-->>View: {code:0, data:{weight, ...}}
        View-->>User: 更新成功提示
    end

    %% ===== 5. 宫缩计时 =====
    rect rgb(230, 230, 255)
        Note over User,DB: 5. 宫缩计时 — 5-1-1 分析
        User->>View: 进入宫缩计时页面
        View->>API: contractionApi.createSession(pregnancyId)
        API->>Router_BE: POST /api/v1/contractions/sessions
        Router_BE->>DB: INSERT ContractionSession
        DB-->>Router_BE: session
        Router_BE-->>API: ApiResponse[ContractionSessionResponse]
        
        loop 每次宫缩
            User->>View: 点击"宫缩开始"
            View->>API: contractionApi.recordContraction(sessionId, 'start')
            API->>Router_BE: POST /contractions/sessions/{id}/contractions {action:"start"}
            Router_BE->>DB: INSERT Contraction (start_time)
            Router_BE->>DB: 自动结束上一未完成宫缩
        end
        
        User->>View: 结束会话
        View->>API: contractionApi.endSession(id)
        Router_BE->>DB: UPDATE session (end_time, avg_duration, avg_interval)
        View->>API: contractionApi.analyze(sessionId)
        Router_BE->>Router_BE: contraction_analyzer.analyze() → 5-1-1 判断
        Router_BE-->>API: {is_511_met, recommendation}
        API-->>View: 显示分析结果和建议
    end

    %% ===== 6. PDF 导出 =====
    rect rgb(255, 255, 230)
        Note over User,DB: 6. 数据导出 — PDF 纪念册
        User->>View: 设置页 → 导出
        View->>API: exportApi.generatePdf(pregnancyId)
        API->>Router_BE: POST /api/v1/export/pdf
        Router_BE->>DB: SELECT pregnancy + checkups + diaries + photos
        DB-->>Router_BE: 全部数据
        Router_BE->>Router_BE: pdf_generator.generate_pregnancy_book()
        Router_BE-->>API: {task_id, download_url}
        API-->>View: 下载链接
        View->>API: GET /export/pdf/{task_id}/download
        Router_BE-->>User: 下载 PDF 文件
    end
